2️⃣ KTH LARGEST / SMALLEST
int findKthLargest(int[] nums, int k) {
    PriorityQueue<Integer> pq = new PriorityQueue<>();
    for (int num : nums) {
        pq.add(num);
        if (pq.size() > k) pq.poll();
    }
    return pq.peek();
}


📏 O(n log k)

